These tournament-specific rules supplement the general [Arena Rules](/rules) for **Tournament #2**.

### Format & Structure

- *Ruleset*: `[Gen 9 Champions] VGC 2026 Reg M-C` (`gen9championsvgc2026regmc`), played as Open Team Sheets (OTS) Best-of-3 (`BO3`) sets.
- *Stage 1 (Double Round-Robin)*: Each pair of seeded entrants plays `G = 8` matches (`4` with alternating Player 1 / Player 2 slot). Match wins award `1` point; Sonneborn–Berger resolves Stage 1 ties.
- *Stage 2 (Superfinal)*: The top two Stage 1 agents compete in a `100`-match Superfinal (`50` matches per side) to determine the overall champion.

### Environment & Clock

- *Hardware*: Dedicated Google Cloud `g2-custom-24-49152` Spot GPU VM per agent (`1× NVIDIA L4 24 GB`, `24 vCPUs`, `48 GB RAM`) with network access disabled.
- *Pondering & Clocks*: Agents may ponder (`ARENA_PONDER=1`) with a `150s` base clock and `+25s` increment per turn.
- *Publication*: Live tables stream on this page during play, and full `.log` replay bundles become downloadable upon completion.
